{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "EXO",
 "chapter": 33,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.33.1",
   "range": "EXO.33.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "f3190c87",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.33.1#p1-f3190c87",
     "text": "The land of Canaan was surrounded by hills: so those who entered it, must go up by the hills.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "go up hence"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.33.5",
   "range": "EXO.33.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "9f356010",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.33.5#p1-9f356010",
     "text": "That I may either show mercy if you repent, or else punish your rebellion.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "what to do unto thee"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.33.7",
   "range": "EXO.33.7",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "cc5bb6e7",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.33.7#p1-cc5bb6e7",
     "text": "That is, the tabernacle of the congregation: so called because the people turned to it, when they needed to be instructed of the Lord's will.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "Tabernacle of the congregation"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.33.11",
   "range": "EXO.33.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a10e0836",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.33.11#p1-a10e0836",
     "text": "Most clearly and familiarly of all others, Nu 12:7,8; De 34:10",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "face to face",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Nu 12:7,8; De 34:10",
       "ref": "NUM.12.7"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nu 12:7,8; De 34:10",
       "ref": "NUM.12.8"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nu 12:7,8; De 34:10",
       "ref": "DEU.34.10"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.33.12",
   "range": "EXO.33.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "51b3bba6",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.33.12#p1-51b3bba6",
     "text": "I care for you and will preserve you in your calling.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "name"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.33.14",
   "range": "EXO.33.14",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "be3ae871",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.33.14#p1-be3ae871",
     "text": "Signifying that the Israelites would exceed all other people, through God's favour; Ex 33:16.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "presence shall go with thee",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ex 33:16",
       "ref": "EXO.33.16"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.33.18",
   "range": "EXO.33.18",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "4c6fd810",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.33.18#p1-4c6fd810",
     "text": "Your face, your substance, and your majesty.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "glory"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.33.19",
   "range": "EXO.33.19",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "086d5eaf",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.33.19#p1-34427e4f",
     "text": "My mercy and fatherly care.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "goodness pass before thee"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.33.19#p2-0c1d2af9",
     "text": "See Ex 34:6,7.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "proclaim the name of the LORD",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ex 34:6,7",
       "ref": "EXO.34.6"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ex 34:6,7",
       "ref": "EXO.34.7"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.33.19#p3-98cb2592",
     "text": "For finding nothing in man that deserves mercy, he will freely give his.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "mercy on whom I will shew"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.33.20",
   "range": "EXO.33.20",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "7b15c6fa",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.33.20#p1-7b15c6fa",
     "text": "For Moses did not see his face in full majesty, but as man's weakness could bear.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "live"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.33.21",
   "range": "EXO.33.21",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "2fe5989d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.33.21#p1-2fe5989d",
     "text": "In mount Horeb.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "me"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.33.23",
   "range": "EXO.33.23",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "50b94d3e",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.33.23#p1-50b94d3e",
     "text": "As much of my glory as in this mortal life you are able to see.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "back parts"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
